1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:03,560
(Howard:)You can't develop
a problem that fast.

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:04,789
(Sheldon:)You want to bet?
Oh, great,

3
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:06,123
(Sheldon:)now I'm addicted to gambling.

4
00:00:10,332 --> 00:00:13,632
(Leonard:)We can't afford to lose
any more time.

5
00:00:13,636 --> 00:00:16,306
(Howard:)Well, this probably won't
work, but has anyone ever tried

6
00:00:16,305 --> 00:00:20,245
(Howard:)to just haul off and
whoop the crazy out of him?

7
00:00:20,242 --> 00:00:23,112
(Leonard:)That's not helpful.

8
00:00:23,112 --> 00:00:25,712
(Leonard:)It's fun to think about,
but it's not helpful.

9
00:00:26,916 --> 00:00:30,186
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon, we are on
a serious time crunch.

10
00:00:30,186 --> 00:00:31,756
(Leonard:)We can't do this
without you.

11
00:00:31,754 --> 00:00:33,254
(Leonard:)Can you please
pull it together?

12
00:00:33,255 --> 00:00:35,325
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.
Yes, of course.

13
00:00:35,324 --> 00:00:37,354
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

14
00:00:37,359 --> 00:00:40,499
(Sheldon:)Just, please, bear with me
if I display symptoms

15
00:00:40,496 --> 00:00:42,426
(Sheldon:)of caffeine withdrawal.

16
00:00:42,431 --> 00:01:05,021
(Howard:)No worries.

